# "idir" (between), paired with "agus".  In its plain spatial and temporal
# sense it leaves both bounds unmutated ("idir Corcaigh agus Gaillimh"); the
# separate "both ... and ..." sense that lenites them is not a date range and
# is not read here.  Source: en.wiktionary.org, https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/idir
idir
